+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is HTTPS everywhere, with no exceptions: plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal traffic is held to the same HTTPS requirement as all other traffic. Certificate verification also stays on for all builds.
